Name: cgp-certbot-dns
Version: 2.2.0.dev7
Summary: Supervised adaptive Cloudflare DNS authenticator for CGP Certificate Manager
Requires-Python: >=3.9
Requires-Dist: certbot>=2.9
Requires-Dist: dnspython>=2.6.1,<3

This distribution is shipped with CGP Certificate Manager and discovered by
Certbot when the cgp-certbot wrapper places the application on sys.path.
